# A scripted session for f117run: one option per line, '#' starts a comment.
# Boots the game, answers SETUP (no joystick, AdLib), lets the logo and intro
# play, completes the pilot form, takes the briefing, arms, launches, flies
# a few seconds and quits with Alt+Q, Y. Inputs only - no game data.
# The defaults assume the GOG roster (a pilot on the second line).
--type
SETUP.EXE+200000:N
--type
SETUP.EXE+2000000:2
# Squadron Bulletin Board: Enter on the highlighted pilot opens the form,
# then Form Complete, then Exit.
--type
START.EXE+30000000:\r
--click
START.EXE+120000000:258,182
--click
START.EXE+200000000:283,172
# Home: the briefing door; Select Weapons; Go to Hangar; Yes.
--click
START.EXE+400000000:280,60
--click
START.EXE+700000000:272,134
--click
START.EXE+900000000:271,148
--click
START.EXE+1100000000:225,191
# In flight: quit the mission.
--type
VGAME.EXE+300000000:\aq
--type
VGAME.EXE+400000000:y
--steps
5000000000
--time-us
700000000000000
